<title>ITALY: RALLYING-LEADING POSITIONS IN SAN REMO RALLY.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-LEADING POSITIONS IN SAN REMO RALLY.</headline>
<dateline>SAN REMO, Italy 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading postions after 13</p>
<p>stages of the San Remo rally on Wednesday:</p>
<p>1. Colin McRae (Britain) Subaru Impreza three hours 27 minutes</p>
<p>and 16 seconds</p>
<p>2. Carlos Sainz (Spain)  Ford Escort Cosworth 18 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) Subaru Impreza	 1:22</p>
<p> 4. Bruno Thiry (Belgium) Ford Escort Cosworth     1:41</p>
<p> 5. Franco Cunico (Italy) Ford Escort Cosworth     2:50</p>
<p> 6. Freddie Loix (Belgium) Toyota Celica GT4	 2:53</p>
<p> 7. Gilberto Pianezzola(Italy) Toyota Celica GT4   3:10</p>
<p> 8. Didier Auriol (France) Mitsubishi Lancer	 3:50</p>
<p> 9. Angelo Medeghini (Italy) Subaru Impreza	  5:32</p>
<p>10. Patrick Bernardini (France) Ford Escort Cosworth 6:34</p>
</text>
